{
  "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "hanyuan",
  "palette": "gold",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liqinghe",
    "shenheng",
    "tangjian",
    "hetaihou",
    "wenqiao"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "公开双方已经办成与尚未办成的事，以有限人手选择补证取舍",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l1",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "交班的凭据收好了吗，唐典记？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l2",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "两张长案拼到一起，案脚高低不齐。唐垫进薄木片，水碗才不往一侧滑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l3",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "收好了，刚从掖庭走过来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l4",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先放着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l5",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "月前榜上定了三项：钱够不够、人能否递进文书、错办的事能否查改。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三项都看你们拿得出的凭据。得两项支持，就奏请陛下授位。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先比办成了什么，再定谁得这一席。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "陛下准的是这三项，不能临场再添一道题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "管钱、收文书、查错案的三位官员入席，都已说明与候选人没有亲故。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "每人只查自己管的那一项，署名写清为何支持谁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我宣读，太后监议，都不另投一票。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我只交经手凭据，不入评议席。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "沈衡……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "替你收卷的差事撤了，可我们仍有往来，不能装作不相识。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "与我亲近的官署也不来评。我的用钱办法，让别人问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_joint_review": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三处查荐书的钱已付，可无人肯荐的，仍进不来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_joint_review": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没有人脉的，又被拦在外头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_open_questions": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "自行来答问的能递进材料，可远处人的路费还没补足。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.nomination_open_questions": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "纸上准她来，钱却没给到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两条路都得留。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没人荐的，许她自己递。来不了的，请人替她送。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "请人替她送，总不能叫人白跑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l25",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "gte": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你问过“你的钱呢”。这回代递的工钱，从哪儿出？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l26",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "gte": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我记得。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l27",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "lt": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代递的工钱从哪儿出？观里不能再替你接这一回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l28",
      "when": {
        "ming": {
          "lt": 6
        },
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能再让她们腾人了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不从观里抽人，从扩办的钱里出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_halfday_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "观里答应的半日校读，钱已付清，不能再算她们欠着差事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_halfday_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "把结清的勾出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_trip_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "观里按次验封的钱已付清，不能再当现成人手调来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.nvguan_trip_pay": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这笔结清的也勾出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的十页核完了，钱也收了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "颂文撤了。“已经有衣”那句话，别再拿去招人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "收到钱的凭据在这。十页的工钱，单独记了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l38",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l39",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "柳承欢接了三夜，省的工费在这一页。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l40",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l41",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她失去的三日休也得计，不能当零。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l42",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三夜另雇两人，工费已经支了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l44",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你亲做的半日交班，不能再算作备议。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l45",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这两处文书的错，底簿记着是柳承欢查出的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l46",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l47",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "简录只写你总管，不能据此说错处都是你亲自查出的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l48",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只列我的名，是我准的。这句也记下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l49",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "连这句一起留下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l50",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "底簿和简录都写了柳承欢做的事。你署的是总管。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l51",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l52",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "逐项的功，没有合到你名下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l53",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "核账官用指背碰了碰未盖印的一栏。李将那页从自己面前转过去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l54",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我添办事处的钱，要等各署下月一同拨来。眼下只保两处轮班收件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l55",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这个月还添不了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l56",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那两处，已经有人递到？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l57",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "收到文书的凭据在这。没安排代送的地方也圈了，不能说全办成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l58",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "给我看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l59",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "李令仪怎么答反对的话，已查过一轮。原件在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l60",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "再核，要多久？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l61",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "限三日。可要找别的官署补认署名，还没试过能否赶上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l62",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "一跨官署，就未必赶得上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l63",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "反对我的那页，当事人已经署名确认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l64",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今夜再对原件，就得占两个人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l65",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今夜这两人就不能另派了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l66",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "反对我的那页，眼下只是收了，还没查完。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l67",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "要来作证的人已出署。最后议定之前，补不齐她们的署名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l68",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能当作已经查证了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l69",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原定六处若减为两处，余钱够眼前开支，也够请人代送文书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l70",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那另四处得往后推。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l71",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可六处都有人等着来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l72",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l73",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "四处都要告知延期，那两位复核的人也得出去查代送办没办成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l74",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我若让两人验完再回来——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l75",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "等等，今日只够走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l76",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "往返赶不回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l77",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "去了外头，今夜就不能留在案前对原件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l78",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那两处既能自己递，也有人代送。若办成了，比我的轮班收件多一步。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l79",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l80",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "也能只补足钱，或只安排代送。这样能留两人在这里查卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l81",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "慢些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l82",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没补的那件，照原样记，不能算成办好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l83",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你交来的材料都有本人署名，留下的人能把改前改后全部对过。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l84",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "谁改了哪一处，都查得到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l85",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_public": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "对，比光留一份原稿，还能找经手的人问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l86",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你缺的是出署那人的确认。光把查卷的人留住，也补不齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l87",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还没回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l88",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_objection_deferred": true,
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不能叫在场的人替她认下那些字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l89",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "若不愿缩六处，也可照原案送，留人核卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l90",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "六处的打算不撤。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l91",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "hetaihou",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "只是案上写下六处，不等于眼前就有钱可付。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l92",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已领来的，不退给人等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l93",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "新增的四处？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l94",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "若要缓……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l95",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l96",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "逐处写明再议的时限。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l97",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门外两名受雇复核人等着领差。日影已移到门槛，她们今天只够走一趟。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l98",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三位评议官都列好了要查的凭据。今日照你选的办法花钱办事。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l99",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我还在看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l100",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "明早办成多少，就算多少，不能凭空补一票。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l101",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（钱不是多出来的。拿给这一处，另一处就得等。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l102",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": false
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "几种办法各花多少，拿给我看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l103",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将本月余款与下月拟拨的两页分开，指尖压住月份。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l104",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "各署合拨的钱还没到，那两处眼下花哪笔？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l105",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这页是本月，这页是下月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l106",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先用已查清的本月余款。下月才拨的，不能算今日已有。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l107",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "先支的是手里这笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l108",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我也借不到下一月的钱，两处以外的人今日仍得等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l109",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那其余的……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l110",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两笔分开列。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l111",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日已有多少、下月还缺多少，分别写。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l112",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "别把今日下月读成一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s08_hanyuan.l113",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch03_cost_question": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "唐将两页并排放下，没有往支持栏添字。"
    }
  ],
  "dressing": "gongyi",
